                  "desc": "The character to which this is attached has their $[K100] dealt converted to $[K105], and they will deal +1 $[K105].\\n<color=#FFFFFFFF>When the character to which this is attached uses a $[K52]:</color> +2 additional DMG.\\n<color=#FFFFFFFF>If the character this card is attached to is the active character, when you perform \"Switch Character\":</color> Spend 1 fewer Elemental Die. (Once per Round)\\n<color=#FFFFFFFF>$[K4]: 2</color>",
