              "name": "Thundering Penance",
              "desc": "$[K1]: When your active character is <color=#FFFFFFFF>$[A1403]</color>, equip this card.\\nAfter $[A1403] equips this card, immediately use <color=#FFD780FF>$[S14032]</color> once.\\nWhen your $[A1403], who has this card equipped, creates an <color=#FFFFFFFF>$[C114032]</color>, it will have the following effects:\\nStarting $[K4] +1, $[K104] dealt by the character to which this is attached +1.\\n(You must have $[A1403] in your deck to add this card to your deck.)",
