            "id": "362278",
            "name": "\"Bottoms Up\"",
            "description": "A large-capacity, easy-to-use metal beverage dispenser often utilized by the Lightkeepers.\\nThese dispensers are common at gatherings, where they help ensure that every attendee can drink as much as they wish.",
