            "description": "A short-growing plant with distinctive foliage that is often compared to a bird's plumage.\\nSome scholars claim that the shrub originated in the Brightcrown Mountains and dubbed it the \"Brightcrown Plumebush\" accordingly. But none of them ever actually researched the plant \u2014 they just made bookmarks from its leaves.",
