            "description": "A lightweight and portable storage desk often seen in the Fortress of Meropide that is quite reliable, and can store a large quantity of miscellaneous items. Quite sturdy, after being loaded up, these are used by some individuals as part of their weightlifting routines, and are excellent aids for strength training.",
