            "id": "373120",
            "name": "\"Feather-Light Praise\"",
            "description": "Harpasta that have been piled up, awaiting use.\\nThese harpasta contain the lovely dreams of the people of Mondstadt and are the essence of this annual festival. Even those who generally eschew exercise will mount a few in their homes as decorations just to join in the festive atmosphere.",
