            "id": "370737",
            "name": "\"Fine Sand in Warm Weather\"",
            "description": "A lightweight tent of rather special make that can only fit a few people for a short period of rest. It can be packed up very quickly and is man-portable, and is as such favored by mercenaries who wish to stay light and mobile... if they can get it on good authority that the next few days will not see any bad weather, that is.",
