            "id": "361204",
            "name": "\"Lost Between the Pages of a Book\"",
            "description": "A master-crafted bookshelf made from birch. Not only can it hold numerous books, but it even has an exquisite Fontaine-made clock in the middle.\\nThe turning clock-hands and the mountains of books also serve to represent the time that has flown by and the endless store of things that need to be done.",
