            "id": "373385",
            "name": "\"Rtawahist Flag\"",
            "description": "A flag planted by the Akademiya during the Akademiya Extravaganza. This deep blue variant represents Rtawahist, reflecting their arcane wisdom in astrology and the reading of fates...",
