            "id": "360480",
            "name": "\"Shimmering Luster\"",
            "description": "A lighting fixture commonly found within the Temple of Space. It boasts a unique and graceful silhouette. While it gives off a gentle glow that is never overly bright, it illuminates its surroundings perfectly with a soft, shimmering luminescence.",
