            "id": "372408",
            "name": "\"Southern Sweetleaves\"",
            "description": "A plant that grows in warm regions.\\nIt sports large, hardy leaves that give off a strong and distinctive sweet-and-sour scent when dried and smoked. Some in Liyue also turn them into fans, which can sell for a reasonable price.",
