            "id": "361344",
            "name": "\"Whispers in the Moonlight\"",
            "description": "A table commonly found in Piramida. This simple square table is crafted entirely from sheet metal.\\nEvery quiet evening, the Ratniki sit around a table like this, speaking in hushed tones. As for why they don't make too much noise, perhaps it's to avoid disturbing any roaming spirits that may be about?",
