            "id": "371014",
            "name": "Adjustable Metal Barrier",
            "description": "An adjustable metal barrier frequently seen around Piramida, commonly employed as a defensive measure.\\nThis defensive apparatus can usually withstand a substantial number of attacks, but its drawback is equally evident: transporting it elsewhere demands considerable effort.",
