            "name": "Base Auxiliary Building: Multipurpose Greenhouse",
            "description": "An auxiliary building on the Kerplunk-a-tron Windmill Base built with thick walls and special exhaust pipes. It is connected to an external boiler that keeps the indoor temperature stable. A building of this type is perfect for use as a temporary guestroom, a bathroom maintained at a constant temperature, or a special heated workshop alike.",
