            "description": "This standard ceiling at the Kerplunk-a-tron Windmill Base is made out of uniform cut metal plates. It is easy to install and clean, and offers excellent functionality and safety. As it is reputedly made from the same material as the outer shell of kuuvahki mechanisms, it is strong and relatively light, which obviates various safety risks.",
