            "id": "360507",
            "name": "Base's Soft Tranquility",
            "description": "A standard chandelier at the Kerplunk-a-tron Windmill Base that consists of a metal suspension fixture fitted with multiple lamps. Its overall style is simple and sturdy. When night falls and the lights come on, the soft glow of these lamps transforms the interior into a warm, tranquil haven, easing away all of one's fatigue and worries.",
