            "description": "A naturally-standing woodcarving torso that can be used to assemble an \"Aranara Carving.\" It's painted blue and reminds people of a forest stream.\\nWith its swinging hands, it resembles the lively and energetic Aranara in fairy tales who may appear anywhere in the forest.",
