            "id": "373224",
            "name": "Bright Verdure",
            "description": "A small bonsai plant commonly found around the abandoned research institute. It is full of vitality \u2014 so green and lush that merely seeing it immediately lifts one's spirits.\\nFor some reason, the plant seems perpetually brimming with life, so much so that one who doesn't know any better might ask if it's being watered with some special potion...",
