            "id": "371141",
            "name": "Bronze Curio: Ancient Golden Visage",
            "description": "A statue of Rex Lapis with an opulent golden mask in hand, a commemoration of the time he entered a certain strange and wondrous realm.\\nThe mask is solemnity itself and strikingly decorated.\\nIt has the air of an object that seems to be telling a tale that hearkens back to some mysterious and wondrous history...",
