            "id": "363413",
            "name": "Burst of Appetite",
            "description": "A platter that can be found near everywhere in Nasha Town, commonly piled high with hearty chunks of bread and sausages.\\nGolden-crusted loaves and sizzling packets of meat... few hungry travelers can resist such a feast. That said, once this display makes its way into the Serenitea Pot, it serves only to stimulate your appetite...",
