            "id": "371204",
            "name": "Carved Courtyard Fence",
            "description": "The outer fence of a Mondstadt courtyard. It doesn't look like it would keep slimes out, given how high they can jump. But slimes don't tend to eat the kind of flowers that grow in a courtyard, so it's no big deal.",
