            "description": "A model based on an empty paint bucket, inspired by the daily creative lives of Natlan's people. They say that a spent, overturned paint bucket symbolizes a journey of uninhibited expression and a story's perfect ending. What, then, could be more appropriate than placing such models by the corners of graffiti-covered walls?",
