            "name": "Companion Gift - \"Playful and Lively\"",
            "description": "A doll made in the likeness of Hu Tao, faithfully capturing her playful and lively nature. It is a gift from the \"Claw Convoy\" organization to thank those who adopt animals.\\nThree joyful little ones, spreading happiness throughout the day \u2014 may you and the little ones always be cheerful and enjoy your time together!",
