            "id": "361119",
            "name": "Deduction and Induction",
            "description": "A board used to compile and display collected intelligence that can be found at the Curatorium of Secrets in Nasha Town.\\nWhen tackling any complex problem, the first step is to organize all known information and carry out a thorough round of logical deduction. For this purpose, this fully equipped and sizeable intel board is a highly useful tool.",
