            "id": "371220",
            "name": "Encampment Fence: Honing Goad",
            "description": "A wooden fence built around an encampment that has been painted with a special coating that has fireproofing properties and a very smooth surface, making it hard to climb.\\nCarving wooden palings is a very droll and laborious task, and veterans in the Shogun's Army will often give such work to new recruits to \"hone their will.\"",
