            "id": "362132",
            "name": "Factory Stool: Multirole Seating Device",
            "description": "A stool commonly found within the Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau. It features a minimalist design and is both solid and sturdy.\\nThis stool has no backrest, making it easy to move to wherever it's needed. Besides its primary function, it can also serve as a simple workbench, footrest, weight... or even a makeshift hammer.",
