            "description": "A bright, dazzling model star that can be placed on a \"Good Shelf\" for display.\\nThe stars make regular appearances in fairytales, tirelessly guiding people on their way forward. As such, look up to the skies when in doubt. Perhaps a miracle may descend upon you.",
