            "description": "A serious-looking paper frog model that can be placed on a \"Good Shelf\" for display.\\nOnly the strictest of conductors may forge the finest bands, and so too is the art of model-making. Only the strictest quality control can make the best products. As such, this model, based on a band conductor, has taken on new purpose \u2014 to exhort Xudi to demand the best of himself every time.",
