            "name": "Favonius Conference Table",
            "description": "A long table made of Cuihua Wood. Meetings and business talks are often held here.\\nPlease be cautious of the metal edges. Designs of this kind are intended to prevent the knights' armor from damaging the table, but the results might be less than desirable if you were to bump into it while dressed in casual clothes.",
