            "description": "A simple, large crate crafted from Adhigama Wood that is suited for mass production. Can be used to store fish for sale. To prevent it from going stale \u2014 which they do very often \u2014 the crate's interior is coated with a layer of wax made from special spices, which help preserve the original flavor of the fish.",
