            "id": "360441",
            "name": "Forbidden Zone Floor Lamp: Nightlight",
            "description": "A standard floor lamp from the Fortress of Meropide that uses a metal frame and a glass lampshade, with some additional external support structures meant to increase durability.\\nThe other major purpose for those support structures is to prevent them from being kicked over by some careless person. With the support structures in place, the only thing that might break is that negligent soul's toes.",
