            "id": "364301",
            "name": "Fragrant Cedar Door",
            "description": "A door made of fragrant cedar.\\nThis door has a window and it bears a simple yet lovely pattern.\\nShowing yourself to your visitor through the windowpane is one aspect of Liyue's tradition of receiving guests.",
