            "id": "374804",
            "name": "From Here I Gaze",
            "description": "A vine-wrapped resting seat in the style of Silvermoon Hall.\\nWhen night deepens and the sleepless find respite here, they need only look up to gaze at the eternal full moon in the sky.",
