            "id": "363415",
            "name": "Frost Moon Small Table: Aroma of Fresh Fruit",
            "description": "A small table commonly found indoors around Frostmoon Enclave. You can usually find the freshest seasonal fruits on it.\\nThe fruit on the table isn't just for eating \u2014 it doubles as a natural perfume. Its subtle aroma of the fruit fills the room, striking a perfect balance that makes the room feel instantly warm and cozy.",
