            "description": "A stone bed commonly seen around Frostmoon Enclave. While it is covered with a soft blanket, those who lie on it will still find it rather hard.\\nOn hot days, the user will find the refreshing coolness of this bed very welcome. During winter, however, it would be best to lay a thick mattress on it before lying down.",
