            "id": "373712",
            "name": "Gold-Patterned Butterfly Wings Flower Vessel",
            "description": "A flower vessel embellished with golden patterns. The butterfly-wing blue glaze is delicate and polished, with a firm and stable structure, and a solid texture that exudes prosperity and vitality.",
