            "name": "Journey Through Wind and Waves",
            "description": "A common sight on the beach, this surfboard features sleek curves reminiscent of a shark's fin.\\nThose who adore the sea breeze, the crashing waves, and all things trendy are especially drawn to surfing. Though it takes time to tame a board, and the waves will surely topple even the boldest, there is joy in every fall and thrill in every rise.",
