            "id": "363108",
            "name": "Joyful Illumination",
            "description": "Floor lamps made from Karmaphala Wood, with delightful outlines and curves that please the eye without appearing overly complex. Three lamps are set at different heights, serving as a main light, auxiliary light, and nightlight. Turning the three lights on and off in different combinations will satisfy all your everyday lighting needs, providing great convenience and comfort.",
