            "id": "374631",
            "name": "Mechanical Figurine: Flash of Inspiration",
            "description": "A finely crafted mechanical figurine found in Nasha Town.\\nThis figurine has luminous devices installed on its hands, eyes, and head. The creator claims the design was inspired by the flashes of inspiration of an inventor. When a brilliant idea emerges, mysterious energy seems to run through the mind, eyes, and hands, kindling the light of wisdom.",
