            "id": "373936",
            "name": "Mechanical Ornament: Waaaaah",
            "description": "A mechanical ornament assembled from discarded scrap metal and spare parts. Often found in Nasha Town as a decorative fixture.\\nIt seems to be crying out in a loud \"Waaaaah\" with its upraised arms and gaping mouth. Perhaps the artisan who made it felt exactly that during its creation.",
