            "name": "Miniature Candlestand: Miniature \"Sun\"",
            "description": "A portable, compact candelabra whose faint light nevertheless shines like a \"sun,\" guiding those who have lost their way.\\nNo matter how brazen the claws of night may grow, they shall never command the course of human fate \u2014 \"And a blazing light burn anew to cleanse impurities of old.\"",
