            "description": "A common two-story shopfront in Nasha Town, spacious enough to store abundant goods. \"Mead-Boy\" is one such establishment.\\nThe first floor features a generous display area, where the proprietor is able to showcase every fine and delicate item at once. This way, customers can't help but stop for a closer inspection.",
