            "description": "A mobile food stall often seen in Nasha Town. The awnings on either side of the stall serve to shield against the sun and preserve the flavor of the food.\\nThose who are pressed for time don't have the leisure to sit and dine. Instead, they flock to these stalls for portable sustenance between hurried errands.",
