            "id": "370342",
            "name": "Nasha Stall: Unending Search",
            "description": "A mobile sundry stall often seen in Nasha Town, capable of displaying a variety of wares. The small lamp mounted on its side signals nighttime patrons to its location when darkness falls.\\nSuch stalls rarely linger in one place for long. The vendor relocates frequently to high-traffic areas for swifter sales.",
