            "id": "370204",
            "name": "Old Wind-Resistant Mondstadt House",
            "description": "A distinctive-looking Mondstadt building with a steep roof.\\nSaid to be especially wind-resistant, this building is simple to construct and has a long history, allegedly dating back to the age of Decarabian.\\nDue to this connection, it is not a common sight in Mondstadt today.",
