            "id": "361102",
            "name": "Open-Top Fir Shelf",
            "description": "A shelf made from fir. The topmost layer has adopted an open-top concept, which is most convenient indeed for holding large objects and for cleaning.\\nHowever, such designs also accumulate dust and dirt quite easily, making techniques for quick cleaning a must for those who love it when things are all spick and span.",
