            "id": "372403",
            "name": "Ordinary Garden Hedge",
            "description": "Standard garden hedgerow.\\nBecause hedges often contain hidden items, the Knights of Favonius have used them in the past to set up a training ground to simulate battling against Dendro Slimes.",
