            "name": "Peculiar Knotwood Tree",
            "description": "An oddly-shaped tree with a most unusual trunk curvature. Perhaps it is the nutritional makeup of the soil that has forced it to grow in such an unusual fashion, or perhaps it is because some peculiar individuals practiced their combat skills on it.",
