            "description": "A chair made primarily from pedunculate oak wood that is often seen around Frostmoon Enclave.\\nIts backrest has a carved hollow section that resembles a full moon. When placed indoors with a soft sky-blue cushion on its seat, it creates a warm and natural feel.",
