            "description": "A towering mask that can be found for sale at stalls in the Stadium of the Sacred Flame's Chuwen Fair. Its unique shape and blue patterns are said to be inspired by waterborne boats, providing a distinct sense of tranquility. Consequently, beyond its decorative use, some vacationers and those suffering from insomnia wear this mask in the hope of benefiting from its \"calming\" effects.",
