            "id": "372330",
            "name": "Sappan and Vermilion Enjoined",
            "description": "A unique breed of Amur Maple whose crown has a truly strange color, that when viewed from a specific angle, half of it looks sappan-brown and the other half will take on a vermilion shade, with each side making the other seem still more vibrant.\\nDrawing this tree species well is considered by many artists to be a benchmark of great skill.",
