            "id": "372449",
            "name": "Scarlet Swayshroom",
            "description": "Mushrooms with strange shapes that present as a deep scarlet. The fungal stipes of these mushrooms are much tougher than their slender appearance might suggest, being able to hold the weighty mushroom cap up quite well, only waving a little even amidst strong winds. It is for this reason that it has gained the appellation \"Swayshroom.\"",
