            "id": "373304",
            "name": "Simple Cargo Cart",
            "description": "A cart used to transport a variety of goods. Its ability to traverse obstacles is quite limited, so it's best used on a level surface.\\nAs for how to make it roll faster with minimal effort, perhaps one could take note of the Teyvat Travel Guide's suggestions on how to make good use of domesticated hilichurls.",
