            "id": "362277",
            "name": "Simple Stretcher: \"Steady Evacuation\"",
            "description": "A stretcher with a simple but highly functional design. A tool commonly used for medical transport by the Lightkeepers, it is constructed with two poles serving as carrying bars, connected by sturdy fabric between them.\\nApart from the Lightkeepers, these stretchers are also utilized by civilians in Piramida to help those who have difficulty moving about on their own.",
