            "description": "A fence that emphasizes setup convenience, and can just about block the path of a large beast.\\nHowever, these fences are made of rather light wood, which can be plucked out of the ground and used as a staff in a real pinch \u2014 something that probably counts as a secondary form of deterrence...",
