            "id": "374020",
            "name": "Snowman Scarf: Wolfhook Smoothie",
            "description": "A scarf with an alternating violet and white pattern. Can be used to build a Puffy Snowman.\\nThis sort of scarf very much resembles Wolfhook Smoothies. Of course, the children would never dream of eating their snowmen. This is just a method of sharing their favorite things with their creations.",
