            "id": "362101",
            "name": "Soft Lounge Sofa",
            "description": "A spacious, soft sofa of exquisite make. Sitting too long upon such a throne may cause one to sink in, never to return again.\\nPlacing this sofa in one's living room and using it to seat guests discussing important matters can often lead to unexpected results.",
