            "name": "Soft-Hued Hydrangeas",
            "description": "A decorative flower bed seen in Nasha Town, thriving with clusters of white, globular flowers amid broad, rounded leaves.\\nThese flowers bloom in dense, merry throngs. Even in the bleakest surroundings, they retain their bright conviviality.",
