            "description": "A vertical iron street lamp commonly seen around Nasha Town, featuring harsh lines and a minimalist design.\\nIts internal light source has been specially calibrated to cast a powerful beam capable of piercing the thickest gloom, illuminating the path for late-night travelers even in the dead of a foggy night.",
