            "id": "371010",
            "name": "Steelbound Secrecy",
            "description": "A small structure with a peculiar form, often seen at the Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau.\\nBuilt entirely from tempered steel for maximum security, it uses a single small ventilation pipe instead of windows for circulation in favor of absolute confidentiality.",
