            "id": "373305",
            "name": "Sturdy Stone Well",
            "description": "A well-built well made of stone.\\nGiven that the wooden winch system used in older wells could easily be broken and was often stolen by hilichurls for spit-roasting, craftsmen came up with an updated design using stone components.",
