            "id": "372106",
            "name": "Sub-Space Boulder: Refined Beauty",
            "description": "One of the rocks that form part of the basic terrain of adepti abodes. This one is rather conservative in size and weight by comparison.\\nOther than using them as walls or fences, they can even be used as throwing weapons.",
