            "id": "362303",
            "name": "Tavern Rug: Home Away From Home",
            "description": "A rug after the style of those found in Wangshu Inn. There are herbal components in the green dye used to make it that can not only eliminate excess moisture but that also smell uniquely good, leading to a warm and homely atmosphere for the guests.",
