            "id": "362135",
            "name": "Tea Party Chair: Crimson and Gold",
            "description": "A finely crafted tea chair. Its deep crimson frame is elegantly accented with golden patterns, boasting a plush backrest and armrests for ultimate comfort. Guests at the tea party have nothing but praise for it, though some have quietly left a small suggestion: \"If only the cushion were stuffed a little thicker and softer, it would be absolutely perfect...\"",
