            "id": "361348",
            "name": "Tea Party Dining Table: The Perfect Gathering",
            "description": "An exquisite tea party table adorned with beautifully symmetrical patterns.\\nWhat makes a gathering truly perfect isn't how grand the feast is, nor how many fun activities are planned. As long as friends can gather around this round table, the moment is already flawless.",
