            "id": "370718",
            "name": "Treasures of the City of Wisdom",
            "description": "A lofty tower with the same appearance and construction as Kalimi Exchange in Sumeru City. According to legend, there are numerous fortified rooms in the spacious basement that are heavily guarded and usually used to store critical documents of the Exchange. Surely, they can also be used to store unimaginable sums of Mora and various other types of precious goods.",
