            "id": "373106",
            "name": "Umbrella Shop: Kaleidoscope of Parasol Colors",
            "description": "Sells various kinds of parasols.\\nSome of these umbrellas can only block the sun's rays and are not to be exposed to the rain. The lantern's light may affect the observed coloration of the parasols, and color contrast is also something to consider.",
