            "description": "A worn wooden decorative shield. It should still have no trouble blocking a hilichurl's arrows.\\nShields of this kind are often worn by knights. The Knights of Favonius undergo strict training, and will in no wise allow the sharp section underneath the shield to hurt themselves by mistake.",
