            "id": "364205",
            "name": "Well-Worn Sword",
            "description": "A well-used decorative one-handed sword. Weapons of this kind have been popular for many years.\\nAfter a bit of sharpening, it should be able to slice thin leather armor.\\nNormally, if one could take up some old weapon and take up a threatening enough stance, one might be mistaken for a real expert and emerge victorious without a fight.",
