            "id": "374053",
            "name": "Wooden Head: Hmph",
            "description": "A smirking woodcarving head that can be used to assemble an \"Aranara Carving.\" It is unpainted and has the unique texture and aroma of logs.\\nA fairy tale writer wrote several fairy tales about the mischievous Aranara who used to be pranksters and eventually admitted their mistakes. Unfortunately, these fairy tales have inspired more naughty children...",
