            "id": "374103",
            "name": "Wooden Hilichurl Fence",
            "description": "A hilichurl-style wooden fence made unusually sturdy by the use of large and heavy fir planks. The timber even seems to have been treated with some ancient lost art that allows them to ever so slightly withstand erosion by Pyro.",
