            "id": "372306",
            "name": "Yellow Sandbearer Tree",
            "description": "A sandbearer tree with yellow foliage.\\nIt is not known why the leaves of this particular variety of sandbearer tree stay yellow all year round.\\nSome say this tree produces a white fruit that can cure little-understood illnesses, but there has never been any proof that this is the case.",
